Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄州 1995年）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:10.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（古巴）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:30.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（21年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:45.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩洛哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:59.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（挪威）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.73,0:30:11.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布达佩斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.53,1:27:19.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（红房）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.94,1:46:02.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在退出）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.66,1:49:00.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在登陆）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.75,1:49:04.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动数据传输）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.24,1:49:33.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（数据传输完成）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.37,2:02:12.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2周后）
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.72,2:11:37.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女儿 姐姐 复仇者）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Nat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都倒过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌你会先撑不住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bet you're gonna fall down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不 你先撑不住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快撑不住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hold it much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了你会先撑不住的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you you'd fall down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛 我就说嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you! I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她摔到膝盖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fell on her knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你磕到膝盖了吗 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you bump your knee? - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲亲就不疼了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss it better. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 你是个勇敢的姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're a brave girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的痛苦只会让你变得更强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pain only makes you stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说对吧 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧 - 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,森林的星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forest stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们其实是属于萤科的昆虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are actually part of the Lampyridae family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种光 你看到它们发的光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the glow, the glow that you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是因为一种化学反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that comes from a chemical reaction called…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做生物发光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bioluminescence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 该吃晚饭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫生物花光吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bio-goomin-feasants?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「生物花光」 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bio-goomin-feasants." That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃晚饭啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吃晚饭了 大姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dinner, big girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要奶酪焗意面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want mac and cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要奶酪焗意面吗 好吧 那我就要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you want mac and cheese? Okay. Well, I want…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼子酱和香槟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}caviar and champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿餐巾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the napkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你端一下这个 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮爸爸拿一下牧场沙拉酱吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, would you grab the ranch dressing for Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的蔬菜就是青豆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green beans are my favorite vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家今天过得怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was everybody's day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈今天跟我说了小灯虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy taught me about lamp bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小灯虫 - 我还跌倒磕伤了膝盖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lamp bugs. - And I fell and hurt my knee,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在不疼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't hurt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯嗯 - 我们还在后院看到了萤火虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mmm-hmm. - And we also saw fireflies in the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我今天最开心的时候 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was my favorite part of the whole day. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叶莲娜 我们每年都能看到萤火虫 - 我们有多少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yelena, we see fireflies every year. - How long do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 可能一个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Like, an hour, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我说过有一天我们要去大冒险吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you remember when I told you that one day we would have that big adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在今天 - 好耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Today's the day. - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 我们得抓紧 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, we gotta hurry. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还没穿鞋 - 谢谢 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have my shoes. - Thank you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 不用穿鞋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. You don't need your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我还很饿 - 是吗 跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I'm still hungry. - Yeah? Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我车里有水果卷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Fruit Roll-Ups in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个别带 放下 去车上等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, leave it, leave it, leave it. Go wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 东西在你那吗 - 在的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仅有这一份备份吗 - 只有这份没烧掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the only copy? - It's the only one not on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你好笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, you're silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才从家走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听我的歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再见吧 美国派小姐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Bye, bye, Miss American Pie ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 开着雪佛兰上河堤 而河堤已干涸 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Drove my Chevy to the levee but the levee was dry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 老朋友们喝着黑麦威士忌 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Them good old boys were drinking whiskey and rye ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 高声唱着「今日就是死期」 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Singing, "This'll be the day that I die" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今日就是死期 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ This'll be the day that I die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你写过爱情之书吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Did you write the book of love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你相信天国的上帝吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And do you have faith in God above ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果这是圣经的指示 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If the Bible tells you so ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那你现在相信摇滚乐吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Now do you believe in rock and roll ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 音乐可否拯救凡人的灵魂 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can music save your mortal soul ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你可否教我跳上一曲 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And can you teach me how to dance real ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 叶莲娜 宝贝快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Yelena. Hurry up, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:06:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快点 小娜 快 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on, Nat. Hurry up. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 快 跑起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. Come on, you gotta run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 亲爱的 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Honey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你妈妈走 跟着她 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go with your mom. Go with your mom. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜 快点 - 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nat, hurry up! - I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 爸爸为什么不上飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Why isn't Dad in the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 他来了 宝贝 他很快就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming. He's coming, baby. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你到前面来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝右边打方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to pull right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你身上有血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you've got blood on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,推那边的加速器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the accelerator there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开稳了 开稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it steady, hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度达到55节你就拉升{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna pull back at 55 knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起来数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's count together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,45 50…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}45, 50…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,向后拉 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,用全力向后拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back. All your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒啊 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦只会让你变得更强 记得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain only makes you stronger, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色守卫者回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Guardian returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色守卫者凯旋而归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Guardian returns triumphant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 求求你别再给我安排潜伏任务了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, I beg you. No more undercover work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要战斗 我想重新穿上战衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna get back in the action. I want my suit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太想念那感觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna get back in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫将军 我已经这样过了三年多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Dreykov, it's been over three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:11:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别让他们动摇你的本心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let them take your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Уйти в
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西拿到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那北方研究所呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the North Institute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,付之一炬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜的情况怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Melina?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会活下来的 她很顽强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll live. She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy? Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 我来处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 爸爸 - 叶莲娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! Daddy! - Yelena!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 离她远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许碰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们全都杀掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不许碰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把枪递给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to hand me that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再回那地方去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想留在俄亥俄州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna stay in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能把她带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才六岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被带走时候比她还小呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were even younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么你们会没事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why it's gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的女儿们 是世界上最坚强的女孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause my girls are the toughest girls in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要照顾好彼此 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take care of each other, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切 一切都会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything, everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩 她身上憋着一股劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one, she has fire in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah… Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑寡妇》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把残次品都清理掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove all the defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 拿着它 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it! Take it! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始红房就是你的家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Room is your home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有卧底间谍潜伏在我们的社区之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undercover spies in our communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用的是假身份 甚至伪装成一家人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took on false identities, even raised families…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们上去了 长官 - 第一梯队视野清晰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're topside, sir! - Tier 1 has LOS!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经封锁了所有出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got all exits covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 保持警戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在派遣第一小队进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending in alpha squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎·罗曼诺夫违反了索科维亚协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha Romanoff is in violation of the Sokovia Accords.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还袭击了瓦坎达的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She assaulted the king of Wakanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要拿她杀鸡儆猴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make an example out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别做什么 - 别追我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what? - Come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 你孤注一掷的样子是在自取其辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're embarrassing yourself. It looks desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你打给我是为了妥协{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought maybe you'd be calling me to cut a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为从我的角度来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause from my vantage point,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤注一掷的人 是你这个联邦逃犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the federal fugitive who's desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我的角度来看 你需要卧床静养{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my vantage point, you look like you could use some bed rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了 心脏第二次搭桥了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, your second triple bypass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不必担心自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到了巴顿 抓到了威尔逊 还有另一个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Barton, we got Wilson and that other guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信的会缩小的罪犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the incredible shrinking convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯还在逃 你现在可是孤立无援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers is on the run. You got no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 在遇到你之前 我已经有过多重身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lived a lot of lives before I met you, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不该这么麻烦来一遭 我说完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have gone to all this trouble. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romanoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯国务卿 这是出空城计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got an empty nest, Secretary Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的追踪器 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her tracker, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已瞄准 她在等包裹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on target. Waiting for the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经瞄准目标旁边的一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sights on collateral one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Firing in place of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发现我们了 目标放置烟雾弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made us. Target deployed smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带着包裹跑了 你守住高地 我转地面行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on foot with the package. Stay high. I'm going to ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克莎娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oksana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,解放其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.09,0:20:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜 我们需要你的情况报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena, we need a status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜 请报告你的状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena, we need a status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你的队长会和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Converge on team leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫将军 我们当中出现了叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Dreykov, we have a deserter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问是否需要激活模仿大师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to activate Taskmaster Protocol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在索科维亚协议事件之后 国家展开了对剩余复仇者的追捕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the Sokovia Accords, the hunt is on for the remaining Avengers…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·罗杰斯与娜塔莎·罗曼诺夫目前在逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Steve Rogers and Natasha Romanoff are currently on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡了我的床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我连被子都没盖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm not even under the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:22:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的你都准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get everything on my list?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:23:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了护照 准入签证 几张当地司机的驾照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got passports, entry visas, a couple of local driver's licenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,混搭着用的话 你应该能转换20个左右的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mix and match, you should be able to stretch it to 20 or so identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,范尼·隆巴顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanny Longbottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.97,0:23:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 还怎么了 你是12岁小孩吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What, are you 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.89,0:23:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个名字合法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a legitimate name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们外面有台发电机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a generator outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧汽油的 那个化粪池过几个礼拜要冲冲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's petrol-powered. And the septic tank will need a flush in a couple of weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我也找好了人来做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, you know, I've got a guy coming for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔垃圾得到城里 开车只要二十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to haul your rubbish into town. It's just a 20-minute drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的基础五金件我都放到楼梯下面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got your basic hardware kit stashed under the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了 有关复仇者联盟的分崩离析…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear things. You know, something about the Avengers getting divorced…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人待着反而更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually better on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 你可以和我倾诉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you can tell me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友就是要这样嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way the whole friends thing works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我有朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.53,0:23:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有朋友的人才不会来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who have friends don't call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是花钱让你担心我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't pay you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些垃圾都是什么玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 就是些从布达佩斯安全屋寄来的邮件和私人物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just some mail and personals from the Budapest safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Budapest?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.15,0:24:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 布达佩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.10,0:24:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 发音应该是「布达佩诗」 - 布达佩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's "Budapest." - Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.88,0:24:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「布达佩诗」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "Budapest."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.37,0:24:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 我知道你不会再回到那了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I knew you weren't going back there, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.71,0:24:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把公寓租给别人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got someone else in the flat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你费这么大力气 我应该让你扔掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry you went through the trouble. I would've told you to chuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你不想要 那就扔进垃圾桶咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you don't want it, throw it in the rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 您又不是运动员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a sportsman, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.84,0:25:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要破坏你跟我的宠物蟒蛇的会面呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you break up the encounter with my pet python?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.83,0:25:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现 他对我有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I discovered he had a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 登月一号准备发射… - 噢 真是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moonraker 1 on preset launch program… - Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…两分钟后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…minus two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回船员通道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retract crew access…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.73,0:27:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定罗斯在这里没有司法权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure Ross has no jurisdiction here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也应该知道我被惹怒的时候枪法更准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should know I'm a better shot when I'm pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.25,0:28:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是冲我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.34,0:30:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.97,0:31:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你知道我在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know I'm out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么还偷偷摸摸地像探地雷一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you skulking about like it's a minefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.85,0:31:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不知道我能不能相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I don't know if I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.88,0:31:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣 我也准备问一样的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny, I was going to say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.17,0:31:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要像成年人一样谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we gonna talk like grown-ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不就是成年人嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我制服你之前 把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down before I make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.94,0:31:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你的放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put yours down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.25,0:31:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意你的脚下 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch your step. - Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.05,0:32:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下去 躺下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down. Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.18,0:32:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.33,0:33:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.22,0:33:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.18,0:33:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前就来过布达佩斯 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to come to Budapest, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.27,0:33:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是因为觉得你不会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here because I thought you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.43,0:33:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过既然你来了 我想问问什么子弹才能打成那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since you're here, what bullet does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.25,0:33:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是子弹 是箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bullets. Arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.95,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 有道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.80,0:33:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得我不会来这 为什么要给我寄去这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you didn't think I'd come here, why'd you send me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:33:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又把它带回来了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought it back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.89,0:34:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来和你交朋友的 不过你得告诉我那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here trying to be your friend, but you need to tell me what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.66,0:34:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是种合成气体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a synthetic gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.27,0:34:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,反化学控制的中和剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The counteragent to chemical subjugation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.58,0:34:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,气体可以使大脑的神经通路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas immunizes the brain's neuropathways.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.58,0:34:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,免疫于外界操纵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from external manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.83,0:34:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你说点人能听懂的英语呗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in English next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.14,0:34:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是思想控制的解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an antidote to mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真成熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不把它拿给你的超级科学家朋友们看看呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take it to one of your super-scientist friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.98,0:34:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就能给你解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许给托尼·斯塔克呗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Stark, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.69,0:34:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对 我们正冷战呢 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. We're not really talking right now, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.45,0:34:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 真会挑时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.57,0:34:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要复仇者的时候怎么就找不到人了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's an Avenger when you need one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.90,0:34:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想待在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.12,0:34:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正逃亡呢 你可能会害死我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the run. You could've gotten me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你说我该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我认识的唯一一个超级英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only superhero person that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此我才寄给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the whole reason I sent it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.13,0:34:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在关注新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept checking the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.75,0:34:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,期盼着看到美国队长摧毁红房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}expecting to see Captain America bringing down the Red Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.96,0:34:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.90,0:34:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁红房 你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking down the Red Room? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.16,0:35:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它已经消失很多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been gone for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.54,0:35:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,徳雷科夫已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.38,0:35:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲手杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.23,0:35:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的相信他死了吧 不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't actually believe that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真相信啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really do believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.15,0:35:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,徳雷科夫死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.90,0:35:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几乎毁了整座城市才找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took almost destroying the entire city just to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.15,0:35:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你那么确定 那你告诉我发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're so sure, then tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.23,0:35:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确地告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.88,0:35:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们布置了炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rigged bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.85,0:35:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「我们」是谁 - 克林顿·巴顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's "we"? - Clint Barton.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死徳雷科夫是我叛逃进入神盾局的最后一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Dreykov was the final step in my defection to S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.76,0:35:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 当然了 「简单」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, "simple."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.76,0:35:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸掉一个五层的大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'd call imploding a five-story building.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后和匈牙利特种部队交火 我管这叫「简单」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then shooting it out with the Hungarian Special Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们躲躲藏藏十天才从布达佩斯逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took 10 days in hiding before we could even get out of Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.81,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你检查过尸体了吗 确定杀死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you checked the body? Confirmed the kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.18,0:35:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有能检查的尸体了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no body left to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.91,0:35:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了徳雷科夫的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgetting Dreykov's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是要往哪跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we trying to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找摩托车 在大楼东侧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motorbike! East side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们往东跑了 去房顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going east, to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.23,0:37:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 马上追击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.06,0:37:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.85,0:37:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.10,0:37:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.15,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 你受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.39,0:38:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.08,0:38:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.74,0:38:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 是他逼我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - He's making me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.71,0:38:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在相信我了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.23,0:38:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many others?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.86,0:38:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.20,0:39:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个是你的 - 黑车 座椅是棕色的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one's yours? - Black. Brown seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.55,0:39:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钥匙呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.19,0:39:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ah, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.21,0:39:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.32,0:40:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.45,0:40:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妙啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.32,0:40:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能直接偷人家的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just steal a guy's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.79,0:40:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想让我追着他把车还他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want me to chase him down and un-steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.86,0:40:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行行好 别磨磨唧唧 - 闭嘴吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Any time now, please. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.63,0:40:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你有计划吗 还是我一直躲着就成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you got a plan, or shall I just stay duck-and-cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.98,0:40:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划是咱俩开车逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my plan was to drive us away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.96,0:40:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这计划烂透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shit plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.32,0:41:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.33,0:41:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 他追来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.30,0:41:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your seat belt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.43,0:41:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是婆婆妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.08,0:42:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我在流血 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm bleeding. I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.37,0:42:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在不行 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not now, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.09,0:43:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.59,0:43:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 计划不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.60,0:43:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢我差点流血至死的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the part where I almost bled to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还挺舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.77,0:43:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和巴顿在这上面躲了两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton and I spent two days hiding out up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.74,0:43:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must have been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.52,0:43:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是谁啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.06,0:43:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,徳雷科夫的特别项目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov's special project.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.18,0:43:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以模仿他见过的任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can mimic anyone he's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.36,0:43:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他打就像是对着镜子打架一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like fighting a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.25,0:43:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫只派他执行最高级别任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov only deploys him for top-priority missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.59,0:43:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全不合理啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.09,0:43:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忽视了重要细节 真相也就没法合理啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the truth rarely makes sense when you omit key details.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.69,0:43:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.04,0:43:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只字未提德雷科夫女儿的事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say one word about Dreykov's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.38,0:43:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也别无他法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.01,0:43:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得靠她才能找到德雷科夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed her to lead me to Dreykov.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.15,0:43:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得确认德雷科夫在那栋楼里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need confirmation Dreykov's in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.61,0:43:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他停车了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His car is pulling up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫的女儿是连带伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov's daughter was collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.64,0:44:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有靠她来确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed her to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 可以确认目标么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.39,0:44:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果现在你却在这里动摇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are, not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.33,0:44:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须离开红房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.31,0:44:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,红房还在运行 位置在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Room's still active. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.24,0:44:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一概不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.94,0:44:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫时常变更基地位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He moves location constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.33,0:45:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,出入口都有姑娘们把守 固若金汤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every widow is sedated on entry and exit for maximum security.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.29,0:45:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是很难相信 他竟然能躲过我的视线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just finding it hard to believe that he could stay off my radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.78,0:45:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 想隐藏自己的人不会蠢到招惹复仇者的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not smart to attack an Avenger if you want to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.46,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 你名声很大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the clue is in the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.69,0:45:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫杀了你的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov kills you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.24,0:45:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些大佬里就会有人来替你报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the big ones comes to avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.08,0:45:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你说啥大佬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what are the big ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.61,0:45:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得天神下凡打完架后应该不用嗑布洛芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I doubt the god from space has to take an ibuprofen after a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.45,0:45:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这些年来我在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you think I was all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.98,0:45:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你逃了出去 过上了正常人的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that you got out and were living a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.62,0:45:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就不曾联系我咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just never made contact again?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.32,0:45:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲真 我以为你不想见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I thought you didn't wanna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.01,0:45:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 扯犊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.11,0:45:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不想要小妹妹拖你的后腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just didn't want your baby sister to tag along,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响你和酷佬们拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whilst you saved the world with the cool kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.78,0:45:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不是我真正的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't really my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟也不是你真正的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Avengers aren't really your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么老是那么做 - 做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why do you always do that thing? - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.30,0:46:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你打架时候做的那个动作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing you do when you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.96,0:46:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就…像这样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… Like, the…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.40,0:46:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.37,0:46:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开打你就这样甩头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you whip your hair when you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.46,0:46:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊半张 头发后甩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the arm and the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.02,0:46:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是 摆了个战斗造型的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do, like, a fighting pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.54,0:46:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就很…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.33,0:46:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个战斗造型 简直装腔作势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fighting pose. You're a total poser.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.17,0:46:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才没有 - 哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a poser. - Haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.97,0:46:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧你 其实造型很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. I mean, they're great poses,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.38,0:46:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但感觉你以为所有人都在看你似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it does look like you think everyone's looking at you, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.48,0:46:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.11,0:46:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我每次忙着摆造型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that time that I spent posing,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.77,0:46:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实都是想尽力做些善事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to actually do something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.80,0:46:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去弥补因为我们而造成的伤痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make up for all the pain and suffering that we caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.63,0:46:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是做一个训练有素的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to be more than just a trained killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.38,0:46:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 那你就是在自欺欺人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you were fooling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.78,0:46:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤痛不会就此休止 我们也仍旧是训练有素的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because pain and suffering is every day and we are both still a trained killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.13,0:46:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我没有像你一样登上杂志封面罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except I'm not the one that's on the cover of a magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.10,0:46:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被小女孩们崇拜为英雄的杀手也不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the killer that little girls call their hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.93,0:47:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种气体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gas,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.73,0:47:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个解毒剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the counteragent,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.71,0:47:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一位跟梅丽娜同期的年长「寡妇」秘密合成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was synthesized in secret by an older widow from Melina's generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.36,0:47:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉命执行回收它的任务 她对我使用了这种气体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the mission to retrieve it, and she exposed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.72,0:47:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却把解放了我的「寡妇」杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I killed the widow that freed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.08,0:47:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时有得选么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.23,0:47:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是经历过心理控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you experienced was psychological conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.95,0:47:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的可是被化学药品改变大脑机能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about chemically altering brain functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.02,0:47:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本质上就大相径庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're two completely different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.85,0:47:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意识完全清醒 但不知道哪个你才是真实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fully conscious, but you don't know which part is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.84,0:47:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在也不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.04,0:47:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剩下的都在这儿了么 - 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that all there is left? - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.81,0:47:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这个能阻止德雷科夫和他的「寡妇」网络了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing that can stop Dreykov and his network of widows.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.58,0:48:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在夜以继日地纳新{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes more every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.56,0:48:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募无人保护的女孩们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children who don't have anyone to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.26,0:48:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小时候的我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like us when we were small.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.20,0:48:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约二十人里能有一个经受住训练 蜕变为「寡妇」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one in 20 survives the training, becomes a widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.94,0:48:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都死于他手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest, he kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.31,0:48:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他而言 我们不过是物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To him, we are just things.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.52,0:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没身份的武器 可以随意丢弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons with no face that he can just throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.52,0:48:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟新人源源不绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there is always more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,托你和阿列克谢的福 都没人试着找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one's even looking for him, thanks to you and Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿列克谢是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexei?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「咱爸」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dad."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.27,0:48:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可曾找寻过父母 你的亲生父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever look for your parents? Your real ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.19,0:48:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我亲妈把我遗弃在大街上 就像扔垃圾一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my mom abandoned me in the street like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.01,0:48:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.11,0:49:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的出生证明被销毁了 所以我自己另建了档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They destroyed my birth certificate, so I reinvented it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.91,0:49:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案里我的父母还住在俄亥俄州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents still live in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.28,0:49:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐去了大西部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister moved out west.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.52,0:49:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.18,0:49:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定上你是教科学的老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a science teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.62,0:49:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那只是兼职 尤其是你生了儿子之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working part-time, though, especially after you had your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.03,0:49:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你丈夫 他负责房屋翻修{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband, he renovates houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.02,0:49:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的故事可不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.31,0:49:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是啥样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.23,0:49:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不过长时间独处 所以无暇细想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never let myself be alone long enough to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.06,0:49:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可曾幻想过生育子女呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever wish for kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.25,0:49:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想养条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.91,0:49:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来要去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.34,0:49:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.20,0:49:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有能回去的地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really have anywhere to go back to,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.47,0:49:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以去哪儿都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I guess anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.86,0:50:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你别 - 别什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - Don't what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.90,0:50:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这大英雄是要絮絮叨叨谆谆教导我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to give me some big hero speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.71,0:50:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能觉察得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.39,0:50:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实不擅长说教{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speeches aren't really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.52,0:50:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.99,0:50:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这更像是一种邀请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was more like an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.83,0:50:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去红房然后杀了德雷科夫吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go to the Red Room and kill Dreykov?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.99,0:50:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.05,0:50:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我们根本找不到红房在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though the Red Room is impossible to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.28,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管德雷科夫老奸巨猾难以下手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dreykov is too slippery to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.13,0:50:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.84,0:50:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来工作量有点大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a shitload of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.00,0:50:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.35,0:50:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过应该会很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be fun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.21,0:50:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.06,0:50:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他把钥匙放在哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw where he put the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.09,0:50:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最上面的抽屉 绿色柜子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top drawer, green cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.21,0:51:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这是我买给我自己的第一件衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is the first piece of clothing I've ever bought for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.67,0:51:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你身上那件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.65,0:51:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 你不喜欢吗 - 这难道不像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. You don't like it? - Is that like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.32,0:51:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队剩余物资之类的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it army surplus, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.56,0:51:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这件衣服上有很多口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it has a lot of pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.10,0:51:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我随时都用得上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I use them all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.70,0:51:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我自己还做了点改进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I made some of my own modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.04,0:51:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是吗 - 随便你吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.10,0:51:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了 重点在于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. The point is, I've never…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.60,0:51:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前没有掌控过我自己的人生 现在可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had control over my own life before, and now I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.85,0:51:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做随我心意的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.38,0:51:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.96,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的背心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.00,0:51:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我就知道你喜欢 很酷 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. I knew it. I knew you did. It's so cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.08,0:51:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很好看 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good. Yes. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.24,0:51:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都想不到你可以在口袋里面放多少东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can put so much stuff in there. You wouldn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.15,0:51:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我真的不知道红房的具体位置 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't know where the Red Room is, though. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.58,0:51:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.37,0:51:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想有一个人肯定知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I know somebody who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.20,0:51:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦是吗 谁啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.88,0:51:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一架喷气飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need a jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.18,0:51:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们需要的是一架喷气式飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said we needed a jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.54,0:52:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你少给了我什么吗 时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what you didn't give me? Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.73,0:52:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有钱 我又不是喷气机做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or money. I'm not made of jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.50,0:52:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你是最棒的呢 像个真正的专业人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were supposed to be the best. Like a real pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.28,0:52:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对不起 女沙皇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I beg your pardon, tsarina.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.50,0:52:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是免费公寓和终生供应的东欧甜点不合您心意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the free flat and lifetime supply of kissel not to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.47,0:52:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈 - 你别被她惹急了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha! - Don't let her wind you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.01,0:52:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我反对有人质疑我的专业性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I take exception to impugning my professionalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.84,0:52:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 但你确实给我装了一个六小时后就坏掉的发电机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did set me up with a generator that crapped out after six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.70,0:52:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也开始了是吗 真是好搭档啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too, huh? Tag team.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.18,0:52:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 他好敏感 我明白你为什么把他留在身边了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, he's sensitive. See why you keep him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.45,0:52:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.30,0:52:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.35,0:52:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦呜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.54,0:52:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那个是大概五年前我藏起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I stashed that, like, five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.27,0:52:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.14,0:52:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很干巴 真的很干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dry. It's really dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.88,0:52:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你的账款快花光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're getting dangerously close to running out your tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.41,0:52:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,物资能记在我账上 但是你让我引起当局的注意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supplies I can tally, but you bring me attention from the authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.27,0:52:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收的价格涨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all my prices go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.18,0:53:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.10,0:53:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友 罗斯国务卿 一直在打探我的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mate, Secretary Ross, has been sniffing around my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.41,0:53:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,以至于我的联系人都不接我的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the point at which I've got contacts declining my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.55,0:53:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个私人承包商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a private contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.84,0:53:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很敏感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.30,0:53:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的很烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very annoying individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.61,0:53:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会补偿你的 - 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll make it up to you. - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.29,0:53:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次都这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you say every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.89,0:53:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我拿到了核武器密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have the nuclear code.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.86,0:53:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他就在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.18,0:53:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国队长 - 美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain America! - America.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.26,0:53:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于红色守卫者的时刻终于来临了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, the Red Guardian's time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.57,0:53:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住他的盾牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grab hold of his shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.61,0:53:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对面地 考验力量的时候到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and face to face, it's a test of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.68,0:54:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…哦不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.89,0:54:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.74,0:54:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙还以为他能打败我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy think he going to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.43,0:54:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之这面盾牌 你们知道的 他总是随身带着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, this shield, you know, that he carries with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.02,0:54:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小宝宝珍贵的毯子一样 懂吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a precious baby blanket, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.93,0:54:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我利用了这一点 我夺走了盾牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use it to my advantage. I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.27,0:54:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他推出了窗外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I push him out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.03,0:54:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我成功逃走了 怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I make my escape. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.60,0:54:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是哪一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.37,0:54:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记不太清楚了 大概83 84年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Like, '83, '84.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.25,0:54:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.93,0:54:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长那个时候还被冻在冰块里呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain America was still frozen in ice then.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.81,0:54:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是觉得我在撒谎吗 大熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you calling me a liar, Ursa, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.25,0:54:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿列克谢·肖斯塔科夫 收到邮件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexei Shostakov1 Mail Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.98,0:54:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.00,0:54:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿列克谢·肖斯塔科夫 收到邮件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexei Shostakov1 Mail Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.27,0:54:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 瞧瞧这个大熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, look at the big bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.79,0:54:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要哭了吗 小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna cry, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.19,0:55:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大名鼎鼎的「红色守卫者」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The famed "Red Guardian."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.94,0:55:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在回信里叫你的粉丝多放点黄油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you write back, tell your fans to use more butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.78,0:55:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.70,0:55:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.06,0:55:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色守卫者上前 喇叭里在喊你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Guardian forward! The trumpet is calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.27,0:56:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日 阿列克谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is your lucky day, Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.90,0:56:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到南边墙上的门那里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to the door on the south wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.18,0:56:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.39,0:56:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认字吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.29,0:56:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.71,0:56:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别引起太多人注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.08,0:56:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色守卫者跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Guardian is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.39,0:57:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你引起所有人的注意了 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a scene, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.56,0:57:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.41,0:57:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gettin' you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.08,0:57:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the upper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的 超级士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your ass, super soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.37,0:57:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可能成功的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.14,0:57:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.66,0:58:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的主意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.96,0:58:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.82,0:58:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可真会摆姿势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a poser.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.49,0:58:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.83,0:58:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.52,0:58:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.33,0:58:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛呢 你在逗我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.93,0:58:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.51,0:58:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩干得都很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both doing a really good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.90,0:59:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.98,0:59:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我受够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.75,0:59:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.37,0:59:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.42,0:59:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的死法还挺酷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would be a cool way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.22,0:59:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那是个好兆头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that's a good sign for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.86,0:59:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.22,1:00:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.75,1:00:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.48,1:01:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.48,1:01:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.16,1:01:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿需要点帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.00,1:01:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜了 傻逼们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.83,1:01:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜了 傻逼们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.75,1:01:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚可真够刺激的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.65,1:02:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 我太为你们骄傲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm so proud of you girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.42,1:02:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你们听不到我说话 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you can't hear me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.18,1:02:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.31,1:02:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.26,1:02:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.45,1:02:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么凶干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the aggression, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.09,1:02:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶上生理期了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it your time of the month?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.68,1:02:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有生理期 蠢蛋 我没有子宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get my period, dipshit. I don't have a uterus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.43,1:02:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有卵巢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or ovaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.31,1:02:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 红房强迫你进行子宫切除手术的结果就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's what happens when the Red Room gives you an involuntary hysterectomy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.64,1:02:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就伸进你的肚子里 然后把你所有的生育器官全掏出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kind of just go in and they rip out all of your reproductive organs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.53,1:02:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们差不多就是直接进去 把那些器官全切下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just get right in there and they chop them all away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.16,1:02:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有东西都掏出来了 你就不能生育了 - 行了行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything out, so you can't have babies. - Okay, okay. Okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.12,1:02:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要说得那么直观恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to get so clinical and nasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.68,1:02:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我本来还想说说输卵管的事的 但是好吧 算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I was about to talk about fallopian tubes, but okay. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.12,1:02:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们回来救我感到很感动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means so much to me that you came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.05,1:03:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你要告诉我们怎么去红房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. You're gonna tell us how to get to the Red Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.20,1:03:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.41,1:03:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 看看你 一副公事公办的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, look at you, huh? All business.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.30,1:03:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这一点都不好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, this isn't pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.86,1:03:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜塔莎已经完全被灌输了西方理念了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Natasha, all indoctrinated into the Western agenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.50,1:03:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自愿选择前往西方成为一名复仇者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose to go west to become an Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.76,1:03:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们待我如家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause they treated me like family.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.46,1:03:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Family?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.52,1:03:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在在哪儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.98,1:03:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些家人现在在哪儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that family now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.82,1:03:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我红房在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where the Red Room is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.18,1:03:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.93,1:03:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.19,1:03:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你和德雷科夫亲近得就像是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You and Dreykov were like…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.12,1:03:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德雷科夫 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dreykov? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.02,1:03:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫将军 是我的朋友 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Dreykov, my friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.13,1:03:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给了我荣耀…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives me glory…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.14,1:03:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联的第一个 也是绝无仅有的超级士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soviet Union's first and only super soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.34,1:03:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以比美国队长更家喻户晓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have been more famous than Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.39,1:03:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他派我去执行那个蠢任务 把我埋在俄亥俄州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he buries me in Ohio on that stupid mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整三年哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.89,1:03:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊到我都想哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tedious, boring me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.79,1:04:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.36,1:04:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他把我扔进监狱里 让我在那里度过余生 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then puts me in prison for the rest of my life. Why, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.88,1:04:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么他要把我扔进…你们知道为什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would he put me in… You know why?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.48,1:04:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能因为是我想说说国家的衰败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause maybe I want to talk about the withering of the state.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.09,1:04:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者可能是因为我不喜欢他的发型之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I don't like his hair or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.91,1:04:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后随口说了一句什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I say something casually about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.46,1:04:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者可能 你知道的 我想让党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, you know, I want the Party.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.25,1:04:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一个真正的党 而不是这样讨人厌的组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feel actually like a party instead of this sourpuss organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.94,1:04:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.79,1:04:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我扔在监狱里让我在那里度过余生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He puts me in prison for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.83,1:04:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他直接逃跑躲起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just runs off and hides, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.41,1:04:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不是那个 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even the one who, uh, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.06,1:04:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不是那个杀了他女儿的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one who killed his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.36,1:04:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以现在就把他扔出窗外吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we throw him out the window now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.21,1:04:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该爬升到更高海拔再说 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should wait till we get to a higher altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.45,1:04:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不问问梅丽娜红房在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not ask Melina where it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.06,1:04:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 梅丽娜妈妈 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Mom Melina?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.22,1:04:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为她早死了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,狐狸可没那么容易被杀死 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot kill a fox that swift.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.17,1:04:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够恶心 - 怎么了吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ew. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是出谋划策的科学家战略家 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the scientist, the strategist.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.14,1:04:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是出体力的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.35,1:05:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很早就在德雷科夫手下干活了 比我还早 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She worked directly for Dreykov far more than I ever did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.40,1:05:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你是说梅丽娜现在还为红房干活吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Are you telling me that Melina is working for the Red Room present day?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.64,1:05:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在圣彼得堡外的郊区工作 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She works remotely outside St. Petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.89,1:05:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.05,1:05:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得剩余的油不够我们去圣彼得堡了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we have enough fuel for St. Petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.95,1:05:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不大 我们能过去的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're good. We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.25,1:05:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.07,1:05:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该开复仇者联盟的超级战机过来的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've brought the Avengers' superjet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.68,1:05:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓要是再听到他多说一个词 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, if I hear one more word from him,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.84,1:05:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就踹他脸上 - 他最讨人嫌了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will kick him in the face. - He's the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.23,1:05:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.82,1:05:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 娜塔莎 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha. Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.56,1:05:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我想问你点事 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.61,1:05:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来嘛 很重要的 - 干嘛 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come, it's important. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:05:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有跟你说过我吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he talk to you about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.92,1:06:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.83,1:06:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有跟你提到我 你懂的 互相交流一下战斗的故事 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he talk to you about me? You know, trading war stories?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.36,1:06:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁啊 你在说谁 - 美国队长 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? What are you talking about? - Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.91,1:06:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场地缘政治冲突中 他是我最大的敌人 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great adversary in this theater of geopolitical conflict.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.09,1:06:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不算是败得彻头彻尾 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much a nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.85,1:06:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更像是同时代的 你懂吗 势均力敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a contemporary, you know? Coequal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.11,1:06:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得我们肯定非常地互相尊重… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought there was a great deal of mutual respect…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.71,1:06:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你已经二十年没见过我俩了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You haven't seen either one of us in 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.80,1:06:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就问我关于你的事吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna ask me about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.52,1:06:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么剑拔弩张的干什么 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is with this tension?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.55,1:06:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做错了什么吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.57,1:06:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话是认真的吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a serious question?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.22,1:06:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直爱着你们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ever loved you girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.98,1:06:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽我所能 确保你们会成功地 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did my best to make sure you would succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.37,1:06:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,激发所有的潜力 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to achieve your fullest potential,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.03,1:06:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后一切都很顺利 - 一切都很顺利吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and everything worked out. - Everything worked out?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.91,1:06:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 对你们来说 是的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. For you, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.84,1:06:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在俄亥俄州完成了任务 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We accomplished our mission in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.06,1:06:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜 你变成了最牛的少年杀手 闻名世界 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena, you went on to become the greatest child assassin the world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.54,1:07:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人像你这样高效 冷酷 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can match your efficiency, your ruthlessness.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.73,1:07:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你 娜塔莎 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Natasha,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.92,1:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不仅仅是颠覆政权的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just a spy, not just toppling regimes,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.58,1:07:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是从内部瓦解帝国的间谍 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroying empires from within,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.58,1:07:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是一名复仇者 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but an Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.28,1:07:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩都杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both have killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.89,1:07:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so many people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.44,1:07:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们身上一定背负着鲜红的血债 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ledgers must be dripping, just gushing red.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.53,1:07:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你们骄傲的不得了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't be more proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你可以…不 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You can… No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.66,1:07:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快放开我 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.66,1:07:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太臭了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell really bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.89,1:07:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们到了吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.38,1:07:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了你就知道了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know when we're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.93,1:07:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右一点 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slight right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.62,1:07:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.79,1:07:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再向右一点 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slight right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.03,1:07:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太棒了我的小宝贝 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very good, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.56,1:08:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.11,1:08:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 很棒 我的小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, very good, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.49,1:08:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,回安全的家里去吧 快点去吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back home where it's safe. Come on. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.34,1:09:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.28,1:09:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 姑娘们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.69,1:09:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临寒舍 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my humble abode.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.10,1:09:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来喝一杯吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你别耍花招 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no funny business.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.64,1:10:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在把我的武器放起来呢 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am putting away my weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.57,1:10:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有什么陷阱吗 有什么需要我们了解的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any booby traps around here? Anything we need to know about?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.02,1:10:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的姑娘们养大 可没教你们跑陷阱里去 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't raise my girls to fall in traps.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.12,1:10:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你压根就没养过我们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't raise us at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.88,1:10:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 也许吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.92,1:10:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要是你们心软了 可不是我的锅 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you got soft, it wasn't on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.67,1:11:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喝吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.58,1:11:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.72,1:11:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,依旧合身 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still fits.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.93,1:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.42,1:11:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没洗过那衣服 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never washed it once.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.12,1:11:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一起喝酒吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.56,1:11:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来吧 解放了的工人们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise, you workers of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.41,1:11:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.06,1:11:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于重聚了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back together again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.43,1:11:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 基于我们的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mmm. - Seeing as our.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.18,1:11:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭关系就是一个只维持了三年的骗局 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}family construct was just a calculated ruse that only lasted three years,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.98,1:11:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得用「家人」二字不太合适了 对吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that we can use this term anymore, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:12:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 听着接下来情况是这样… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed. So, here's what's gonna happen…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.12,1:12:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 那就叫重聚咯 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. A reunion then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.32,1:12:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.35,1:12:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有话不吐不快 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to say something right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.52,1:12:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都没变 是吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't aged a day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.57,1:12:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那么美丽柔顺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just as beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.51,1:12:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就和当初他们假造我俩婚姻的时候一模一样 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as supple as the day they staged our marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.30,1:12:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胖了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.62,1:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是那么厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.37,1:12:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从监狱出来 所以我 呃… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got out of prison. I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.64,1:12:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我精力很充沛哦 - 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a lot of energy. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.69,1:12:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求了 千万别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.37,1:12:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 情况是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.67,1:12:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 别驼背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, don't slouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.03,1:12:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有驼背 - 有 有 你有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not slouching. - Yes, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.87,1:12:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不驼背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't slouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.83,1:12:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背上都快有隆起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to get a back hunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.34,1:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听你妈的话 - 哦天哪 这… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to your mother. - Oh, my God, this…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.96,1:12:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺直 挺直{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.70,1:12:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 够了 你们所有人都闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.33,1:12:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没说 这不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything. That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.29,1:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 情况是这样… - 我什么也不想吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's what's gonna happen… - I don't want any food.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.05,1:12:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃点东西吧 叶莲娜 好歹给个面子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat a little something, Yelena, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.02,1:12:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我们红房的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna tell us the location of the Red Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.71,1:12:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这就像是你告诉她们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's like when you told them that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.69,1:13:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她们可以熬夜等到圣诞老人一样 - 什么 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- they could stay up late to catch Santa Claus. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.81,1:13:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真好玩 就说「他会从烟囱爬下来 姑娘们」 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun. You know, "He come down the chimney, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.21,1:13:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「注意啦 他在哪」 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look out. Where is he?"
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.36,1:13:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们等着他 然后等饼干都吃没了的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait for him, and then when the cookies are gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.72,1:13:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就能看见他就在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you see he's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.30,1:13:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 什么 我想让她们追随她们的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. What? I want them to follow their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.07,1:13:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那没什么好处 - 去摘星星吧 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No good. - Reach for the stars, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.42,1:13:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找德雷科夫可不是个幻想 那是项未完成的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding Dreykov is not a fantasy. It's unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.23,1:13:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打败不了一个控制着别人绝对意志的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't defeat a man who commands the very will of others.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.27,1:13:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从来没见过我们之前在美国开启事业的巅峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never saw the culmination of what we started in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.34,1:13:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor did you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.06,1:13:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 永远集中注意力 集中 去得到你想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, always focus, focus. Get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.99,1:13:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猪刚刚自己开了门吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that pig just open the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.68,1:13:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It did.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.98,1:13:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 阿列克谢 好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy, Alexei. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.75,1:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给猪起了我的名字么 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You named a pig after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.15,1:14:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没发现你俩的相似之处吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see the resemblance?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.70,1:14:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 它可以像狗一样坐着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he sits just like dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.51,1:14:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 现在 看着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing. Now, watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.81,1:14:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉这有点诡异{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little weird, to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.26,1:14:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.23,1:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们潜入了俄亥俄州的北方研究所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We infiltrated the North Institute in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.58,1:14:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那曾经是神盾局科学家的前线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a front for S.H.I.E.L.D. scientists.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.35,1:14:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 在那时候应该叫九头蛇的科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it was Hydra scientists at that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.62,1:14:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,与冬日战士项目协力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In conjunction with the Winter Soldier project,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.44,1:14:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们解剖并且解构了人类大脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they had dissected and deconstructed the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.48,1:14:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造出了第一个也是唯一一个基底神经节的细胞蓝图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create the first and only cellular blueprint of the basal ganglia.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.41,1:14:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是认知能力的核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the hub for cognition.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.00,1:14:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,自主驱动的运动 阶段性的学习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voluntary motor movement, procedural learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.92,1:14:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有窃取武器或者科技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't steal weaponry or technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.95,1:14:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们窃取了解放自由意志的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stole the key to unlocking free will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.48,1:14:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.46,1:15:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我正在解释现在这种科学已经发展得非常精确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am explaining that the science is now so exact,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.44,1:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以命令实验品停止呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the subject can be instructed to stop breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.60,1:15:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们毫无选择只能遵守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has no choice but to obey.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.83,1:15:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你已经说得很明白 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you made your point. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.42,1:15:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好吧 别担心 阿列克谢在没有氧气的情况下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all right. Well, don't worry, Alexei could've survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.57,1:15:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能再活11秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}11 more seconds without oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.29,1:15:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 现在 你回去吧 回到安全的家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. Now, you go back, back home where it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.62,1:15:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 回家 回到安全的家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go. You go back home, back home where it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.38,1:15:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 阿列克谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy, Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.26,1:15:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当世界被控制的时候 它会以更高的水平运转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world functions on a higher level when it is controlled.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.08,1:15:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫已经把用化学方法控制了的特工安插在了全球各地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov has chemically subjugated agents planted around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.78,1:15:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道他们在什么人身上试验吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you know who they test it on?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.84,1:15:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.32,1:15:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 那不属于我的部门负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's not my department.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.31,1:15:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 得了吧你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.22,1:15:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别对她们撒谎 嗯哼 - 我没撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't lie to them. Hmm? - I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.12,1:15:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是德雷科夫的设计师 不是吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Dreykov's architect, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.62,1:15:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么 如果我是他的设计师 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you? If I was his architect,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.90,1:15:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是他的合作伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were his partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.90,1:15:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是他的生意合作伙伴 - 不不不 我当时容易上当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were his business partner. - No, no, no. I was patsy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.93,1:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别跟我说这些… - 他向我兜售观念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't give me that… - He sell me ideology.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.29,1:15:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要再讲政治了 - 一直以来 更大的… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop with the politics. - All the while, bigger…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.60,1:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你就是个蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! You are an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.24,1:15:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.34,1:16:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.96,1:16:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家庭从来都不是真的 所以也没什么好为之坚持的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our family was never real, so there's nothing to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.37,1:16:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在向前看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.82,1:16:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不是家庭 哈 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never family, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.44,1:16:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在内心里 我只是一个普通的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my heart, I am simple man.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.19,1:16:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我觉得对于一对深深潜伏的俄国特工来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that for a couple deep undercover Russian agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.54,1:16:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们作为家长做得还不错 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we did pretty great as parents, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.03,1:16:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们有我们的任务 而且把我们的角色做到了完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we had our orders, and we played our roles to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.76,1:16:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在意 那又不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? That wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.30,1:16:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.22,1:16:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁在意 - 别那么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who cares? - Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.24,1:16:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要那样说 那是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't say that. It was real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.57,1:16:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说是真的 你是我的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was real to me. You are my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.62,1:16:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我真正的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my real mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.69,1:16:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我和一个人曾经拥有的最亲密的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closest thing I ever had to one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.27,1:16:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我人生中最好的部分是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best part of my life was fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.61,1:16:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你们都没告诉过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And none of you told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.96,1:16:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那些特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.02,1:17:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在全球范围内通过化学方法控制他们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you chemically subjugated around the globe?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.51,1:17:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是被控制的那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.98,1:17:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.80,1:17:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 你逃出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, you got out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.83,1:17:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫总是确保再也没有一个人能逃得出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov made sure no one could escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.09,1:17:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算说什么吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna say anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.98,1:17:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.16,1:17:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.39,1:17:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.12,1:17:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从来都不知道 - 没关系的 没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had no idea. - It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.59,1:17:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和她聊聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.38,1:17:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进这里是因为我不想说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came in here because I didn't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.75,1:18:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.84,1:18:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 呃…我们就坐着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh… We just sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.82,1:18:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就坐着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.89,1:18:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.24,1:18:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来做这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do this myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.15,1:18:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. You won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.79,1:18:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我能相信你是在乎我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could believe that you cared.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.01,1:18:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你甚至都不是第一个遗弃我的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not even the first mother that abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.11,1:18:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是被遗弃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you weren't abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.44,1:18:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被一个程序选中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were selected by a program that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.48,1:18:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个评估婴儿基因潜能的程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}assessed the genetic potential in infants.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.81,1:18:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被带走的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was taken?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.69,1:18:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这是达成了协议的 你的家庭也都得到了回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe a bargain was struck, your family paid off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.72,1:18:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的母亲 她一直在找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your mother, she never stopped looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.20,1:18:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和你在那方面很像 她真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was like you in that way. She was.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.34,1:18:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不屈不挠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}relentless.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.74,1:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.12,1:19:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov had her killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.11,1:19:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的存在会让红房暴露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her existence threatened to uncover the Red Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.96,1:19:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常来说 一个平民好奇的行为不会导致她被处决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, the actions of one curious civilian wouldn't warrant an execution,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.61,1:19:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但正如我所说 她锲而不舍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, as I said, she was relentless.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.08,1:19:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生中每一天都在想她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about her every day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.65,1:19:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我自己内心是否承认 我确实每天都在想她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether or not I admitted it to myself, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.94,1:19:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得最好不要回顾过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always found it best not to look into the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.54,1:19:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么保留着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you save this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.90,1:20:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得这一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.93,1:20:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一天内 拍摄了圣诞节 感恩节 复活节还有暑假照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shot Christmas, Thanksgiving, Easter and summer vacation all in one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.47,1:20:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用不同的背景 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Different backdrops. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.98,1:20:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道树下所有的礼盒都是空的 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew all the presents under the tree were just empty boxes, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.08,1:20:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 我想打开每个盒子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care. I wanted to open every single one…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.80,1:20:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以哪怕只有一秒 我都觉得是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so just for a second it would feel real.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.17,1:20:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.12,1:20:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.75,1:20:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么一只出生在笼子里的老鼠会在那个小轮子上跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does a mouse born in a cage run on that little wheel?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.84,1:20:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 在你甚至还没出生的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know I was cycled through the Red Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.54,1:20:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,红房的这套流程我已经经历了四回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}four times before you were even born?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.50,1:20:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道那些墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those walls are all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.59,1:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都没有选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never given a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.30,1:20:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是老鼠 梅丽娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not a mouse, Melina.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.99,1:21:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是生在了一个笼子中 但这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just born in a cage, but that's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.07,1:21:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你是怎么保持你的本心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, how did you keep your heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.91,1:21:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦只会让我们变得更强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain only makes us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.11,1:21:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你告诉我们的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you tell us that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.00,1:21:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠着你教我的东西活了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you taught me kept me alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.23,1:21:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我已经通知了红房 他们随时都可能到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I already alerted the Red Room. They'll be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.48,1:21:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我和我父亲在冰面上钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there I am ice fishing with my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.73,1:21:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这天这个小冰棚里真的很冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very cold day in this little ice shed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.01,1:21:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使对俄罗斯来说也冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold even for Russia, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.68,1:21:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲会对我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Keep the vodka by the fire, "
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.06,1:21:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「把伏加特放在炉火旁」 - 请别说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- my father would say to me. - Please stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.35,1:21:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 等等 拜托了 - 请不要再说了 拜托 我不想说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please wait. Please wait. Please. - Please, no. Please, I don't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.89,1:21:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.20,1:21:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你讲这个是有原因的 好吗 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a reason why I'm telling you this, okay? Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.22,1:21:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伸手去抓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reaching for fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.86,1:22:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我失去平衡了 啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I lose balance. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.98,1:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,水花四溅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splash!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.15,1:22:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手伸进了河里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands go in the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.17,1:22:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种天气里 很快会被冻伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this weather, frostbite sets in quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.68,1:22:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我父亲 他在我手上撒尿 - 噢 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My father, he go toilet on my hands. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尿液温度为35摄氏度 可以防止冻伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urine is 35 degrees Celsius, staves off the frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.77,1:22:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟我有什么联系吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this relevant?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.04,1:22:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.02,1:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲们都是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.71,1:22:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.95,1:22:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也没做 只是告诉我你感觉多么无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done nothing but tell me how bored you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.85,1:22:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是一个无聊的任务 一个你不想做的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the chore, the job you didn't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.32,1:22:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我来说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.65,1:22:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 你就是一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, you were everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.49,1:22:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 你根本不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. You don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.74,1:22:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.50,1:22:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一在意的是你那愚蠢的光辉岁月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you care about are your stupid glory days.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.12,1:22:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是漫画里的绯红机甲 但没有人想听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Crimson Dynamo, and no one wants to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.79,1:23:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是红色守卫者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Red Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.97,1:23:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.38,1:23:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,立马出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.40,1:23:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.97,1:23:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己有没有哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I cried.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.12,1:23:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知晓了他那寡居的新娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I read about his widowed bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.66,1:23:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么触动了我的心弦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something touched me deep inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.11,1:23:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.76,1:23:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The music.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.94,1:23:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.22,1:23:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们高声唱着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were singing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.77,1:23:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见吧 - 再见吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.00,1:23:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国派小姐 - 美国派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss American Pie - American Pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.75,1:23:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着雪佛兰上河堤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drove my Chevy to the levee.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.93,1:23:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而河堤已干涸 - 已干涸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the levee was dry - Was dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.45,1:24:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them good old boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.85,1:24:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝着威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinking whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.60,1:24:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,高声唱着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.34,1:24:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「今日就是死期」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This will be the day that I die"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.72,1:24:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「今日就是…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This'll be the day…"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.36,1:24:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.39,1:24:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.04,1:25:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.49,1:26:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他再等了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not keep him waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.87,1:26:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求降落许可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request clearance for landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.11,1:26:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 你可以在5号机坪降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. You are cleared to land on bay 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.61,1:26:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.53,1:26:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在一分钟内降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're touching down in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.54,1:26:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么还在上升{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are we still going up?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你就知道德雷科夫如何隐匿这么多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll know how Dreykov stayed above the radar all these years.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.44,1:28:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.10,1:28:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.48,1:28:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.06,1:28:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,和家人们的重聚如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how was the family reunion?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.82,1:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 十分糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.80,1:28:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真粘人 特别情绪化 渴望精神支撑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were clingy, and too emotional, and needy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.34,1:28:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就跟以前一样 对吗 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like old times, huh? - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.69,1:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜·贝洛娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena Belova.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.49,1:28:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.25,1:28:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有她一个人受影响 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only one affected, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.72,1:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.92,1:28:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些气体解药 是我的眼中钉肉中刺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These gasses and antidotes, it's a pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.78,1:28:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个棘手的问题 你得解决一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a problem. You need to sort it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.15,1:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我有九只小猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I have nine pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.01,1:28:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不在的时候需要人照顾呢 - 别管你的那些猪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that will require attending to in my absence. - Don't give a shit about your pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.34,1:28:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,解剖她的大脑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut her brain out…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.44,1:29:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 找到她的弱点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Identify the weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.60,1:29:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样死掉一点都不酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a much less cool way to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.05,1:29:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿列克谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.45,1:29:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Romanoff?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.00,1:29:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.45,1:29:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她背叛了她的人民以及她的血缘至亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She turned her back on her people. On her blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在一无所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.51,1:29:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾给过她一个家 给过她爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her home. I gave her love.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.80,1:29:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的那套东西也注射到她身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that thing in her you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.21,1:29:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些你研制出的化学药剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.49,1:29:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她也变为你的一只小猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn her into one of your pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.14,1:30:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象我控制一名复仇者之后会有多大能耐吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine what I could do with an Avenger under my control?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.88,1:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不想先和她谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you like to speak to her first?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.09,1:30:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看向由你抚养长大的孩子的眼睛时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you look into the eyes of a child you have raised,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.44,1:30:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,流露出的情感是不会被掩盖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no mask in the world can hide that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.32,1:30:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.57,1:30:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.41,1:30:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别着急弄坏了我的新玩具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go breaking my new toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.54,1:30:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.79,1:30:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救不出咱俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.99,1:30:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让你知道我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to know that I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.85,1:30:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的生命献给一项事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pledged my life to a cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.78,1:30:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我曾以为我十分勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I thought I was being very brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.39,1:30:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是最勇敢的那位 但其实并不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly the bravest. But I wasn't being brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.41,1:30:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分懦弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.84,1:31:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在古巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Cuba,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.82,1:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们将你们从我身边带走时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they came and took you away from me…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.94,1:31:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么事业是值得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cause is worth that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.39,1:31:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有为了某件值得事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should only sacrifice yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.53,1:31:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能牺牲自己…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.14,1:31:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咋开门的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.83,1:31:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些牢房是我设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I designed these cells myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.94,1:31:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.47,1:31:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.82,1:31:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肺腑之言都说给你听了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bared my soul to you and it was just you the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.45,1:31:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没错 但是稍等 我正在和叶莲娜通讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm afraid so. But wait, shh, I'm on comms with Yelena.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.43,1:31:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜 妈妈在和你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelena, it's me. It's Mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.19,1:31:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的腰带里藏着一把两英尺的匕首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a two-inch blade concealed in your beltline.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.63,1:31:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.25,1:31:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要对我做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.95,1:32:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边大腿外侧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside right hip.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.86,1:32:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她保持清醒准备开颅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her awake for the cranial incisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.54,1:32:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能早点告诉我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have told me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.31,1:32:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹小脾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't throw a fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.52,1:32:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之前没有机会 - 好了女孩们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There wasn't time. - Okay, girls,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.88,1:32:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见你们说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having trouble hearing you,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.33,1:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 娜塔莎 我需要你明白一些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, Natasha, there's something I need you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.60,1:32:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你知道我非常抱歉 我不会再找借口了 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to know that I'm sorry. No more excuses, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.63,1:32:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的生命献给一项事业 我曾认为我十分勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave my life for a cause. I thought I was being brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.83,1:32:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有对讲耳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have earpiece.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.12,1:32:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.59,1:32:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是她听不见你讲话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.73,1:32:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有带对讲耳机 - 我为啥没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have earpiece. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.46,1:32:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这不是计划中的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it wasn't part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.99,1:32:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是吗 那计划是怎样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Well, what was the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.29,1:32:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 一旦我们进入内部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, once we're inside,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.45,1:32:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会启动身上的追踪器 罗斯会追查到此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll activate my tracker and Ross will come running.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.53,1:33:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得自己是一名全球通缉犯呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are aware that you are still a global fugitive, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.34,1:33:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解这里的设备 一定有办法能让它降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the facility. There must be some way to land it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.90,1:33:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,引诱他们在第零层囚禁我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instruct them to confine us on level zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.27,1:33:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我逃出 我就能启动降落程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I'm out, I can activate the landing protocol,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.31,1:33:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在一小时内降落到地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can descend within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.63,1:33:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦 问题来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.44,1:33:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有一套对讲耳机设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only have one earpiece set.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.87,1:33:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给叶莲娜吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it to Yelena.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.45,1:33:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把解药放在哪里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he take the vials?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.64,1:33:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在冷藏室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably down to cold storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.86,1:33:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷科夫仍控制着那些姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreykov still has the widows under his control,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.09,1:33:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你得让她们暴露在解药环境下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you have to expose them to this antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.51,1:33:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 小事一桩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.82,1:33:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.42,1:33:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划是杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.15,1:33:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.37,1:33:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们现在要干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.46,1:33:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的母亲叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was my mother's name?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.19,1:33:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.21,1:33:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们埋葬她的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we buried her,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.00,1:33:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一棵树…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a tree…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.47,1:33:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.33,1:33:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一簇粉红的花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pink blossom.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.37,1:34:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.00,1:34:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一块墓碑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was a tombstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.76,1:34:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面刻着她的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her name engraved on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.55,1:34:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.09,1:34:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.70,1:34:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「无名氏」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unknown."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.10,1:34:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有任何感觉吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.73,1:34:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死你的女儿的时候 你有什么感觉吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel anything when I killed your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.13,1:34:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的旧日阴影吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your haunted past?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.15,1:34:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.00,1:34:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.89,1:34:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我最强大的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me my greatest weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.23,1:34:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个招呼吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.61,1:35:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的炸弹爆炸的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your bomb exploded,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.24,1:35:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点炸死了我的安东尼娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it nearly killed my Antonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.59,1:35:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不在她的后颈里装一块芯片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to put a chip in the back of her neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.22,1:35:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她的后颈里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the back of her neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.17,1:35:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.68,1:35:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她让你难以直视吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find it difficult to look at her?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.85,1:35:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.04,1:35:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…她观察着一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… She watches everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.63,1:35:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后复制出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.34,1:35:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一个完美的模仿者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a perfect mimic.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.41,1:35:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的战斗方式与你所有的朋友一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she fights just like all of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.04,1:35:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能听到我说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can she hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.99,1:35:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.34,1:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让她好受些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.33,1:36:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟她说对不起么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell her you're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.30,1:36:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在把她的脸炸掉之前就该想到这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you should have thought of that before you blew her face off.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.29,1:36:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是废话说够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But enough of all this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.94,1:36:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,干活去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.43,1:36:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地库里有几只老鼠 去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have rats in the basement. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.88,1:36:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.86,1:36:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯了个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.11,1:36:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.62,1:36:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚把唯一能阻止我杀你的东西送走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just sent away the one thing that would stop me from killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.44,1:36:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就试试吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.68,1:36:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.38,1:36:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹没上膛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the safety on?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.23,1:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.05,1:37:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试用刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try your knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.67,1:37:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.81,1:37:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇上麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.20,1:37:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么控制我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you controlling me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.74,1:37:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有控制你 娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not controlling you, Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.35,1:37:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.25,1:37:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有一把信息素锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a pheromonal lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.76,1:37:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要嗅到我的信息素 你就无法对我作出暴力举动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smelling my pheromones prevents you from committing violence against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.76,1:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对梅丽娜很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very upset with Melina.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.54,1:37:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜我不得不杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame I have to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.12,1:37:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托啦 如果我们只是要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now. If we're just going to.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.83,1:37:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下按钮和黑掉电脑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}press buttons and hack computers…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.83,1:37:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我是说 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - I mean, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.88,1:37:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就没有我能做的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing for me to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.21,1:37:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…我想砸点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to… I want to break something.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.20,1:37:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.70,1:37:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你有东西砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there is something you can break.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.33,1:38:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜 如果这是我们最后一次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina, if this is the last time that we…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.85,1:38:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.23,1:38:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那下真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.12,1:38:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.93,1:39:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这就是你们的惊天计划 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this was the big plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.97,1:39:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜要把红房迫降 把我交给政府机关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina was going to land the Red Room and hand me over to the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.41,1:39:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.46,1:39:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 现在怎么样 你要把我塞进你那可悲的小小木偶戏里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now, you're gonna fold me into your pathetic little puppeteer act?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.71,1:39:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可悲的 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.88,1:39:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你怎么称呼它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what would you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.72,1:39:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把它称作… - 你最后一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would call it… - When was the last time that you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.35,1:39:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是强迫别人跟你对话是什么时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a conversation with somebody that wasn't forced to talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.33,1:39:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃到错误的战争中去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran away to fight in the wrong war.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.94,1:39:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的战争是在这里打响的 在阴影之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real war was fought here, in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.41,1:39:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在阴影中战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't fight in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.33,1:39:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是躲在黑暗里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.72,1:39:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的力量来自无法察觉的影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real power comes from undetectable influence.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.54,1:39:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果根本就没人察觉 那为什么还要做呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If no one's noticed, then why even do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.50,1:39:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.51,1:39:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唔 - 你一无所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - You have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.37,1:39:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗星球上有50个人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 50 people on this planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.23,1:39:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 快停下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.39,1:40:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me to stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.54,1:40:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不叫你停下 你怎么知道什么时候该闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't tell you when to stop, then how will you know when to shut up?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.26,1:40:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.42,1:40:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我受不了拳头吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I can't take a punch?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.03,1:40:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.32,1:40:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 你真软弱 - 软弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God damn it, you're weak. - Weak?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.56,1:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着毫无还手之力的小女孩耍威风更容易 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet it's easier to be tough in front of defenseless little girls, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.62,1:40:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.71,1:40:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你明白我所建立的一切有多庞大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be so glib if you had any notion.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.27,1:40:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不会嘴硬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the scope of what I've built.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.70,1:40:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有整个世界 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own this world. Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.21,1:40:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来是拼命想让我佩服你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem desperate to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.04,1:40:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不需要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to impress you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.90,1:40:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要任何人的佩服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to impress anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.65,1:40:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上的那些领导 那些伟人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These world leaders, these great men,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.88,1:40:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都得听命于我和我的姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they answer to me and my widows.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.34,1:41:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.11,1:41:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些女孩命如草芥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These girls were trash.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.03,1:41:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们被扔到街头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are thrown out into the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.40,1:41:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她们捡回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recycle the trash.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.92,1:41:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,赋予她们目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I give them purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.78,1:41:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赋予她们人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give them a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.66,1:41:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜 我找到解药了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina, I found the location of the vials.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.14,1:41:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到点麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a slight setback.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.45,1:41:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得找到那些姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need to get to the widows.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.46,1:41:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的「寡妇」网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my network of widows.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.24,1:41:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它帮助我掌控权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that help me control the scales of power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.77,1:42:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一道命令下去 石油和股票市场就会崩溃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One command, the oil and stock markets crumble.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.05,1:42:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一道命令下去 四分之一个地球就会面临饥荒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One command, and a quarter of the planet will starve.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.22,1:42:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的姑娘们可以引发战争 也可以结束战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My widows can start and end wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.74,1:42:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以缔造统治者 也可以消灭统治者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can make and break kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.30,1:42:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在这里控制着她们所有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You control all of that from here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.78,1:42:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而有了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.18,1:42:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个受我控制的复仇者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Avenger under my control,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.60,1:42:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就终于可以从阴影中走出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can finally come out of the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.24,1:42:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用这个世界上唯一过剩的自然资源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}using the only natural resource that the world has too much of.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.50,1:42:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.28,1:42:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是通过那个小小的控制台吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All from that little console?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.48,1:42:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.59,1:42:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你觉得这很好笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you find this amusing?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.03,1:43:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.15,1:43:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意 但是 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it personal, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.60,1:43:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的配合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.04,1:43:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你知道了数据库的位置 让他把钥匙展示给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you locate the database and get him to show you the key,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.57,1:43:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没法从他那里拿走它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't be able to take it from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.87,1:43:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年以来 德雷科夫在所有姑娘身上植入了一种信息素锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, Dreykov has implemented a pheromonal lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.98,1:43:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all widows, even me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.16,1:43:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 只要我们能闻到他的信息素 就没法伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as long as we can smell him, then we won't be able to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.25,1:43:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我可以屏住呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll just hold my breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.06,1:43:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.91,1:43:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是基础科学知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is basic science.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.61,1:43:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 要想阻断嗅中枢的受体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, to block receptors in olfactory center,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.14,1:43:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得切断神经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to sever the nerve.
