Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.52,2:12:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我甚至无法想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}honestly, I can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.78,2:12:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该在我度假的时候打扰我的 瓦伦蒂娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to be bothering me on my holiday time, Valentina.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.53,2:12:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 打扰你 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bothering you? Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.22,2:12:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是来表达一下我的敬意 - 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just here paying my respects. - Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.41,2:13:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你来这里给我一种孤注一掷的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, coming here makes you look desperate.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.76,2:13:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.42,2:13:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想要加薪 - 哦 是的 你和我都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want a raise. - Oh, yeah. You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.04,2:13:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你会得到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, you're gonna earn it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.73,2:13:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有你的下一个目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got your next target.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.16,2:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该亲手交给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd hand-deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.05,2:13:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你想亲手杀掉害死你姐姐的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'd like a shot at the man responsible for your sister's death.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.60,2:13:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来还挺俊 你不觉得吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a cutie, don't you think?
